  "published": "2026-08-16T16:23:07.143Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0 (BREAKING): Browser interop moves from SpawnDev.BlazorJS to SpawnDev.SpawnJS (+ SpawnDev.SpawnJS.Cryptography, and the SpawnJS build of SpawnDev.MultiMedia). JS values cross the .NET/JS boundary as numeric object-table ids instead of Microsoft JSObject. Cross-platform WebRTC API (IRTCPeerConnection/IRTCDataChannel/RTCPeerConnectionFactory), desktop SipSorcery-fork path, and signaling are unchanged; net10.0-only (SpawnJS is net10.0-only). Carries SIPSorcery 10.0.7. See CHANGELOG.md.",
